


  ┌─ Discard every change ───────────────────────────────────┐
  │ 12 files go back to what HEAD holds on feat/git-         │
  │ workstation.                                             │
  │                                                          │
  │ ✕ every change made since the last commit, in no commit  │
  │   and no stash                                           │
  │                                                          │
  │ runs                                                     │
  │ git restore --staged --worktree -- .                     │
  │                                                          │
  │ type feat/git-workstation to go on                       │
  │ ›                                                      ▌ │
  │                                                          │
  │  enter run it  esc cancel                                │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘




